The roadmap is your spec. Reference it explicitly:

"Implement Step 6 from the roadmap: the Auth data layer. Create AuthRepository with all 6 methods. Follow the CLAUDE.md conventions (no Prisma in services, all timestamps @db.Timestamptz, String UUIDs)."

Never ask for multiple steps at once — each step builds on the previous.

